  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nDE = 75 cm\n\nEF = 100 cm\n\nDF = 125 cm\n\nM is midpoint of DF\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nMedian length = √[(2a² + 2b² − c²) ÷ 4]\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ EM = √[(2 × 75² + 2 × 100² − 125²) ÷ 4]\n\n⇒ = √[(2 × 5625 + 2 × 10000 − 15625) ÷ 4]\n\n⇒ = √[(11250 + 20000 − 15625) ÷ 4]\n\n⇒ = √[(15625) ÷ 4]\n\n⇒ = √3906.25\n\n⇒ = 62.5\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 62.5.**",
